1
00:06:32,307 --> 00:06:38,307
No way back, one way out.

2
00:13:04,615 --> 00:13:10,615
John Wick: Chapter 4 is a action, thriller, crime
film directed by Chad Stahelski.

3
00:19:36,923 --> 00:19:42,923
With the price on his head ever increasing, John Wick
uncovers a path to defeating The High Table.

4
00:26:09,230 --> 00:26:15,230
But before he can earn his freedom, Wick must face off against a new enemy with powerful
alliances across the globe and forces that turn old friends into foes.

5
00:32:41,538 --> 00:32:47,538
John Wick, played by Keanu Reeves.

6
00:39:13,846 --> 00:39:19,846
Caine, played by Donnie Yen.

7
00:45:46,153 --> 00:45:52,153
Marquis, played by Bill Skarsgård.

8
00:52:18,461 --> 00:52:24,461
Winston, played by Ian McShane.

9
00:58:50,769 --> 00:58:56,769
Bowery King, played by Laurence Fishburne.

10
01:05:23,076 --> 01:05:29,076
Charon, played by Lance Reddick.

11
01:11:55,384 --> 01:12:01,384
John Wick: Chapter 4 is a 2023 American neo-noir action thriller film, directed and
co-produced by Chad Stahelski and written by Shay Hatten and Michael Finch.

12
01:18:27,692 --> 01:18:33,692
It is the fourth installment in the John Wick film series, and the
sequel to John Wick: Chapter 3 – Parabellum (2019).

13
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
Keanu Reeves returns as the titular John Wick, who sets out for
revenge on the High Table and those who left him for dead.

14
01:31:32,307 --> 01:31:38,307
Chapter 4 also features Donnie Yen, Bill Skarsgård, Laurence Fishburne, Hiroyuki Sanada, Shamier
Anderson, Lance Reddick, Rina Sawayama, Scott Adkins, Clancy Brown, and Ian McShane.

15
01:38:04,615 --> 01:38:10,615
Development of the fourth John Wick film, formally announced by Lionsgate in
May 2019, was confirmed before the release of its predecessor.

16
01:44:36,923 --> 01:44:42,923
It is the first film in the franchise that was not written by franchise creator
Derek Kolstad; Hatten was hired in May 2020, then Finch in March 2021.

17
01:51:09,230 --> 01:51:15,230
Principal photography took place from June to October 2021 in
France, Germany, New York City, and Japan.

18
01:57:41,538 --> 01:57:47,538
The film's planned 2021 release was delayed by the COVID-19 pandemic.

19
02:04:13,846 --> 02:04:19,846
John Wick: Chapter 4 premiered at the Odeon Luxe Leicester Square in London on
March 6, 2023, and was released in the United States on March 24.

20
02:10:46,153 --> 02:10:52,153
The film received critical acclaim from critics, who praised its action sequences, Stahelski's
direction, cinematography, choreography, visual style, writing, score, and performances.

21
02:17:18,461 --> 02:17:24,461
It earned $447.3 million worldwide, on a $100 million budget,
becoming the highest-grossing film in the franchise.

22
02:23:50,769 --> 02:23:56,769
A spin-off set between the third and fourth films,
titled Ballerina, was released in 2025.

23
02:30:23,076 --> 02:30:29,076
Though Chapter 4 was initially intended to be the conclusion
of the series, a sequel is in development.

24
02:36:55,384 --> 02:37:01,384
The film explores themes of new york city, martial
arts, berlin, germany, hitman, sequel.

25
02:43:27,692 --> 02:43:33,692
The tone is dark and intense.
